 A small TypeScript library, with no runtime dependency, of building blocks for our services that store,
 exchange and update JSON: configuration files, API payloads and stored records. It is imported by the
 other projects of the team, so its behaviour must follow the published standards it implements.
+
+## API
+
+### `resolvePointer(document, pointer)`
+
+Resolves a [JSON Pointer](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6901) (RFC 6901) against a JSON `document`
+and returns the value it refers to.
+
+- `document`: any JSON-compatible value.
+- `pointer`: a JSON Pointer string, e.g. `"/foo/0/bar"`, or `""` to refer to the whole document.
+
+Throws a `JsonPointerError` if `pointer` is not a syntactically valid JSON Pointer, or if it does not
+resolve to a value within `document`.
